<title>RUSSIA: Russia may impose taxes on government securities.</title>
<headline>Russia may impose taxes on government securities.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian government plans to impose various taxes on operations with government securities next year, a member of the conciliation commission working on the 1997 draft budget said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Mikhail Zadornov, who is also chairman of the State Duma's lower house of parliament, told Reuters the commission would recommend that the Duma approve these taxes.</p>
</text>
